{"server":"tw","storyId":"act13side_level_act13side_05_beg","groupId":"act13side","stageId":"act13side_05","title":"人言可畏","storyCode":"NL-5","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act13side/level_act13side_05_beg.txt","sourceHash":"12575c88c852d4eb26fbbc067923f3dad474c9e4e4bc5b12103dc4a90ba8a2fa","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"卡西米尔2 5-1"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_warehouse"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凋零騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_102","isRemote":false,"text":"咕——咕啊啊——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"腐敗騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_102_2","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凋零騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_102","isRemote":false,"text":"啊——啊啊啊——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"無胄盟成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_216","isRemote":false,"text":"......報告，凋零騎士服藥後產生了明顯的排斥反應。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"無胄盟成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_216","isRemote":false,"text":"不......在其他騎士身上並沒有發現類似的反應，在場的藥師推測是薩卡茲的過敏反應......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"無胄盟成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_216","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？可......可這很浪費......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"無胄盟成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_216","isRemote":false,"text":"濃度比例......已經接近常規的凝膠修復液了，這玩意是用來修盔甲的啊，繼續注射會對人腦造成不可逆的損傷......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"無胄盟成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_216","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"無胄盟成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_216","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，我明白，他們是薩卡茲，不是人類......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"無胄盟成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_216","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，你們也聽見了，再增加百分之零點三......測試一下薩卡茲的極限。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G05"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"你們，是什麼東西？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凋零騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_102","isRemote":false,"text":"嘎啊......嘎啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"腐敗騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_102_2","isRemote":false,"text":"......你......夢魘......死......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"年輕的夢魘長歎一口氣。他仰頭望去，熟悉的黑夜被燈光驅散。\n這也是文明興起的象徵嗎？卡西米爾在用霓虹燈征服黑夜嗎？\n他突然有些感傷。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_sportsbar"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"各位！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"瑪莉婭！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你沒事......你沒事真是太好了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"哎、哎，佐菲婭姐姐？別、別哭啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"光頭馬丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_107","isRemote":false,"text":"你沒事就好，瑪莉婭。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_120","isRemote":false,"text":"要是你出了什麼事情，我們可沒臉去見臨光老爺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老工匠","speakerId":"avg_npc_101","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然現在也沒臉去見就是了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"啊哈哈......各位還很長壽呢，胡說什麼呢，咳咳。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"那個......佐菲婭姐姐？差不多可以放手了吧......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"托蘭","speakerId":"avg_npc_213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"打擾這一幅姐妹情深的情景實在讓人於心不忍......不過瑪嘉烈似乎不在這裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......呃，你什麼時候......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"托蘭","speakerId":"avg_npc_213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"從你帶著哭腔抱上去開始。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呀......你是誰？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，他是剛才幫我——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_120","isRemote":false,"text":"你......！你、你是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"托蘭","speakerId":"avg_npc_213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你認錯人了，老騎士先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_120","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"托蘭","speakerId":"avg_npc_213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，瑪嘉烈呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"托蘭","speakerId":"avg_npc_213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"出了這麼大事，我們神經大條的耀騎士難道還在勇闖特錦賽嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"......我......我不知道該不該告訴姐姐......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"托蘭","speakerId":"avg_npc_213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嚯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"無胄盟不會善罷甘休的吧......他們遲早會再攻擊過來的，大家都會有危險！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"但是......但是如果告訴了姐姐......才是正中他們的下懷......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"托蘭","speakerId":"avg_npc_213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在這座大騎士領，你們無處可逃，他們遲早都會來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"托蘭","speakerId":"avg_npc_213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今時不同往日，哪怕是下一秒和現在比起來，商業聯合會都在壯大自身。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......為了你的安全，瑪莉婭，你姐姐必須知道這件事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"姐姐知道了，就能解決嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"姐姐放棄了特錦賽，他們真的就會就此甘休嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"（我，我在想什麼......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"托蘭","speakerId":"avg_npc_213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......迷茫不是壞事，別像那個誰一樣就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"托蘭","speakerId":"avg_npc_213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，既然瑪嘉烈不在，我還有點私事，就先告辭了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"慢著，你到底——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_120","isRemote":false,"text":"佐菲婭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_120","isRemote":false,"text":"隨他去吧，別問了，沒事的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但，還是得謝謝你救了瑪莉婭，如果有什麼可以幫你的......和我們說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"托蘭","speakerId":"avg_npc_213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......對了，出劍方向偏了點，瑪莉婭，平衡不對，速度也慢了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"托蘭","speakerId":"avg_npc_213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過看樣子似乎是心態問題，可惜少女心我可就不懂了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"心態......嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"托蘭","speakerId":"avg_npc_213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"騎士的戰鬥可不在賽場上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"托蘭","speakerId":"avg_npc_213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"借來的夢想，是走不遠的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G03"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赦罪師。認真的？這個名字聽著就很厲害。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"質疑的話，去和那位玄鐵本人說說看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......那還是算了，他也是薩卡茲吧，傳奇傭兵之類的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡茲戴爾的薩卡茲，耀騎士，還有這個羅德島......真有意思啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有意思，也有些礙事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一面要應付董事會，一面要應付騎士協會，一面還要兢兢業業地處理感染者，這日子，何時是個頭啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......快了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是啊，快了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但玄鐵老爺們還是不願意露面，那意思是，最後這點髒活全要我們幹囉？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G05"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"托蘭","speakerId":"avg_npc_213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"慢著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"托蘭","speakerId":"avg_npc_213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"手下留情如何？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凋零騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_102","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"......他們敗在我的手裡，我有權處置他們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"托蘭","speakerId":"avg_npc_213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們也是我的同族。我不忍看見同族在卡西米爾落得如此下場，把他們交給我吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"......同族......呵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"骯髒的東西，甚至不配稱為我天途的戰利品。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"各廢去他們一臂，以作教訓。帶他們走吧，別礙眼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"托蘭","speakerId":"avg_npc_213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼好說話？我還以為我們得打上一場。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"托蘭","speakerId":"avg_npc_213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸欸欸，別提刀，當我沒說，當我沒說。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_nearllivingroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"電視裡的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"耀騎士戰勝了燭騎士之後，在媒體和城際網路上掀起了軒然大波。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"電視裡的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"加上最近大騎士領出現了各種非法感染者暴力事件，更加劇了民眾恐慌——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"電視裡的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"零號地塊負責人，商業聯合會發言人將於近日召開記者發佈會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪恩納","speakerId":"avg_npc_108","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G09"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人馬克維茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......總之，就是這樣，博士，阿米婭小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人馬克維茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些日子......零號地塊可能會不太平。之前城內引發的一些暴亂現在都被認為是感染者所為。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人馬克維茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......情況很特殊。但我們也不希望因此終止感染者收容治療的機能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人馬克維茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這幾天，希望羅德島的各位就不要到處走動了，很抱歉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......博士......這些新聞......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礫","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很遺憾，不完全是捏造的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礫","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"感染者騎士確實開始騷動起來，特別是在耀騎士戰勝了燭騎士之後呢......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礫","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"僅當晚發生的暴力事件就有十一起。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"人言可畏，而這些媒體比誰都精通此道。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"真相不會是這樣的。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"......說是有些董事會的重要人物都遭到了襲擊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"哇啊......竟然都出現遊行了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"但願不要影響到那些騎士......昨天那位姐姐還說，贏了比賽要給弟弟妹妹買玩具來著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......那，臨光小姐是不是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_kxstreet"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"抗議的人群","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"感染者離開卡西米爾！感染者不屬於大騎士領！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"抗議的人群","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"感染者收治區等於礦石病培養皿！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"下班的員工","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"......這附近發生什麼了？我怎麼開了個會出門，就變成了這樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"趕路的員工","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？你看對面城區不就是感染者收容治療中心嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"趕路的員工","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"抗議罷了，下午的時候更過分，還拉超大的橫幅呢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G07"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你們有什麼事嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"抗議的騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_217","isRemote":false,"text":"......耀騎士......你知道為什麼那些感染者敢公開行動嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"抗議的騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_217","isRemote":false,"text":"他們在城市裡引發暴力事件......把那些無辜的市民捲入其中，他們哪來的膽子？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"抗議的騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_217","isRemote":false,"text":"是你給他們的膽子！是你和血騎士，你們這些感染者騎士！你讓他們有了反抗的權力！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"抗議的騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_218","isRemote":false,"text":"......我......我知道你不是一個壞人，冠軍。我以前甚至是你的粉絲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"抗議的騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_218","isRemote":false,"text":"但你繼續參加特錦賽，只會給其他感染者一個錯覺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"抗議的騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_218","isRemote":false,"text":"一個......他們可以......改變當下的錯覺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"抗議的騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_218","isRemote":false,"text":"好自為之吧，耀騎士......不要讓自己後悔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G05"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"............"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了，臨光？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"你的表情，可不像是剛大獲全勝的騎士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"char_179_cgbird","isRemote":false,"text":"臨光。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"char_179_cgbird","isRemote":false,"text":"有心事的話，要說出來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......只是關於感染者的一些事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"......這個話題，我有一些別的線索。阿米婭已經知道了這些事，毫無疑問，這些事情背後是被人操縱的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"但是現在的你，不需要分神處理這些事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"相信我，相信羅德島。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"char_179_cgbird","isRemote":false,"text":"你只要安心點亮你的光就好，臨光。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"char_179_cgbird","isRemote":false,"text":"但是......但是也不要太勉強。你很強大，但是你的疲憊在累積。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"char_179_cgbird","isRemote":false,"text":"偶爾也要放鬆一下喔？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......卡西米爾，是我的家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"見到長大的瑪莉婭想要成為騎士，看見佐菲婭和老馬丁他們都有著自己的生活......我很欣慰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是此刻，有你們在身邊，我能感到更加安心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"char_179_cgbird","isRemote":false,"text":"......我們也是臨光小姐的家人嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說不定呢，麗茲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"離入冬還有些時日，但卡西米爾的夜晚總是更加涼爽。麗茲，回阿米婭那裡吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"......你“離開”羅德島之後，大家都很關心你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道，但正因如此，我更不能將他們捲入我的事情裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"......我們就可以了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你們不願意的話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"真難得，耀騎士也懂得開玩笑了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......音樂？是......附近的酒吧嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以前這裡只是一排普通的辦公大樓，我記得，曾是一個出版社。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大騎士領原本並沒有這樣的規模......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但這幾十年間，每逢特錦賽，大騎士領就透過“競標”的方式，選出其他三座城市進行合併。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"四城聯合，卡瓦萊利亞基。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......城市在變化，我對我的家鄉......有些，陌生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"char_179_cgbird","isRemote":false,"text":"你回到這裡沒有多久，臨光。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"而且你立刻扎進了騎士競技裡......扎進了你的理想裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"你還沒有在這裡重新開始生活，確確實實的生活......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"遲早會的，也許不是現在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"char_179_cgbird","isRemote":false,"text":"......你很累了，我能感覺到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"char_179_cgbird","isRemote":false,"text":"要散散步嗎？也許夜風可以吹散你的疲勞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好啊，麗茲，讓我牽著你的手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"char_179_cgbird","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"......燭騎士是個難纏的對手嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡西米爾還有她那樣的騎士，讓我很意外。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她很強，但她的迷茫成為了她的弱點......未能在她全盛的時刻和她分出勝負，很遺憾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"你樂在其中......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......過去我曾無比痛恨騎士競技。不，哪怕此刻，我依舊為如今的卡西米爾深感悲哀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我們......見過了許多，不是嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"三人緩緩踱步在卡西米爾夜晚的街道上。\n遠離了鬧市與喧囂，這條小巷只剩下些許城市的餘溫。\n這些餘溫化作了酒與歌聲，以及匆匆行人所留下的麵包香氣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要做的事情是不會變的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......哪怕，我的命運最後只是一場荒誕的冒險。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"——如夜風中飛行的羽。\n——如滿懷夢想的旅人。\n——騎士踏上征途。\n——去找尋摯愛。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"char_179_cgbird","isRemote":false,"text":"......動聽的歌聲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"也許是一位滄桑的流浪歌手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"char_179_cgbird","isRemote":false,"text":"卡西米爾也會有這樣浪漫的地方嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"這是，有人生活著的證明。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"——如矢車菊般脆弱的命運。\n——將經歷風暴的考驗。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"char_179_cgbird","isRemote":false,"text":"......哼哼......哼哼哼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......麗茲，你想跳舞嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"char_179_cgbird","isRemote":false,"text":"哎？我？我這樣......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒事的，握住我的手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"char_179_cgbird","isRemote":false,"text":"......好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"char_179_cgbird","isRemote":false,"text":"哇......慢、慢點，臨光......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"青鳥飛向了溫婉的深空。\n霓虹燈從高樓的間隙中逃逸，在悠揚的時間中穿梭。\n騎士牽著薩卡茲的手，在影影綽綽的燈光下穿行。\n宛如拉特蘭最崇高的聖像。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"......很美，麗茲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"char_179_cgbird","isRemote":false,"text":"真、真的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"也許有一天，你能夠真正起舞的，麗茲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"char_179_cgbird","isRemote":false,"text":"......那一天來臨的時候，你還會在我們身邊嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"當然。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"騎士停下了舞步，在提燈女神的身前俯下身姿。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我發誓，麗茲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"char_179_cgbird","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G05"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"......我們會等你的，臨光。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"在你道路的盡頭，在你燃盡自己光芒的那一刻來臨之前，我們一定會在你的身邊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"如果那時——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"臨光。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"晚上好，耀騎士......唔，還有那位美麗的薩卡茲小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼快就能再見面，我都有點感動了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["阿米婭"]},{"speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","aliases":["芙蓉"]},{"speakerId":"char_147_shining","aliases":["閃靈"]},{"speakerId":"char_179_cgbird","aliases":["夜鶯"]}]}
